# The Bennet house in Odessa: Noah, Sandra, Lyle and Claire. The fire took the east wing; a young oak grows there now.
# Claire's room survived upstairs. Her chest holds a note for her dad.
# Exported to data/heroesevolved/structure/ruins/bennet_house.nbt.
